            rlog("\n=== Phase 23 Summary ===\n");
            rlog("Strategies tested: pipe spray, IOSurface prop spray,\n");
            rlog("OOL mach_msg spray, pixel data scan, zone churn.\n");
            rlog("Look for *** KPTR *** or *** LEAK *** markers.\n");
